/target
**/*.rs.bk
__pycache__/
# The T tuning panel's saved settings (src/mould/tune.rs, TUNE_FILE): one
# player's knobs, written next to wherever the game was run from.
/mould-tune.txt
/.claude/settings.local.json
# Replays the game writes beside wherever it runs (larder-world's
# `larder-world-replay-MAP-SEED.txt`). One was committed in #192, so every
# game on Flats seed 1 modified a tracked file and play.cmd stopped
# updating ("You have local changes"); 2026-11-14.
/larder-world-replay-*.txt
# The window's play log beside the replay (`mould::playlog`,
# `larder-world-log-MAP-SEED.txt`; read with `cargo run --release --example
# playlog -- FILE`), 2026-11-15.
/larder-world-log-*.txt
# Since 2026-11-17 a file a round in this folder; `play.cmd` sends them to
# the `play-logs` branch and moves them to `play-logs/sent/`.
/play-logs/
